{"hw":"φιλοψυχία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">φιλοψυχία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">φιλοψυχ-ία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ιη,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">love of life,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Iamb.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Protr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φιλοψυχίην ἀναιρέεται</span> he conceives a <b class=\"lex-tr\">desire for life,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πολλὴ μεντἄν με φ. ἔχοι, εἰ</span>.. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">37c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φιλοψυχίας ἕνεκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">944f</span> </span>.</div></div>"}